# DECISIONS.log - append-only ADRs

## ADR-0017: Procedural voice + canvas cinematic engine - 2026-08-08
Context: the cutscene was static text on a gradient, and the user asked for
voice + cinematic effects with zero asset budget. Decision: per-speaker pitch
speech blips via the existing Web Audio bus, and a per-slide animated canvas
background engine (matrix rain / city dawn / glitch / dark pulse) with
letterbox slide-in, crossfade transitions, film grain, vignette, ken-burns
zoom - all CSS + canvas, no video or audio files.

## ADR-0018: Multi-part push due to size limits - 2026-08-08
Context: the full v1.1.0 changeset (12 files including large HTML/TS wiring
files) exceeded the connector's single-call payload limit, causing repeated
silent truncation. Decision: split into 3 sequential pushes by file group.
Consequence: world.ts, index.html, and main.ts (the files containing the
actual leave-building fix and cinematic wiring) could not be included and
require a dedicated follow-up push, tracked in STATE.md.
